---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import RiveBakenMark from '../components/RiveBakenMark.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Brand" description="How to refer to Baken and use the Baken name and mark.">
  <p>
    "Baken" and the Baken mark (two leaning basalt stones) identify the Baken apps. You are welcome to use them to refer to
    Baken accurately, for example in articles, tutorials, reviews, or a "works with Baken" note.
  </p>

  <h2>The mark</h2>
  <p>
    The mark is two stones grounded on a single horizon: a tall anchor stone (your computer) and a leaning pebble (your phone).
    Click either specimen below to trigger the peer-lock settle.
  </p>
  <div class="brand-specimens">
    <div class="specimen specimen-dark">
      <RiveBakenMark size={74} state="ambient" theme="dark" title="Baken mark on dark" />
      <span>Dark surface · default</span>
    </div>
    <div class="specimen specimen-light">
      <RiveBakenMark size={74} state="ambient" theme="light" title="Baken mark on light" />
      <span>Light surface</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Chart palette</h2>
  <p>
    Surfaces stay neutral black and off-white. Colour comes from hand-coloured Dutch sea charts: Buoy Vermilion is the live
    signal; Verdigris, Prussian Indigo and Dune Ochre carry sea, depth and sand.
  </p>
  <div class="swatch-grid">
    <div class="swatch">
      <span class="swatch-chip" style="background: var(--tone-vermilion)"></span>
      <strong>Buoy Vermilion</strong>
      <code>#EE5A3F / #C2412B</code>
    </div>
    <div class="swatch">
      <span class="swatch-chip" style="background: var(--tone-verdigris)"></span>
      <strong>Wadden Verdigris</strong>
      <code>#5FB8A3 / #2E7A6A</code>
    </div>
    <div class="swatch">
      <span class="swatch-chip" style="background: var(--tone-indigo)"></span>
      <strong>Prussian Indigo</strong>
      <code>#7E9CD6 / #2F4A7A</code>
    </div>
    <div class="swatch">
      <span class="swatch-chip" style="background: var(--tone-ochre)"></span>
      <strong>Dune Ochre</strong>
      <code>#D8A84A / #8A6418</code>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Please do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Write the name as "Baken", with a capital B.</li>
    <li>Use the mark as supplied, without changing its shape, proportions or colours.</li>
    <li>Make it clear when something is your own project that works with Baken.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Please don't</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Use the name or mark in a way that suggests we endorse or made your product.</li>
    <li>Use "Baken" as part of your own product, company or domain name.</li>
    <li>Ship a modified build under the Baken name and mark. If you distribute a fork, give it a different name.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Assets</h2>
  <p>
    The mark and wordmark are available as SVG and PNG on request through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> while a
    downloadable press kit is prepared.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>

<style>
  .brand-specimens {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 18px 0 8px;
  }
  .specimen {
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 28px 20px 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .specimen-dark {
    background: #0B0B0D;
    color: #A6A6B0;
  }
  .specimen-light {
    background: #F6F6F8;
    color: #4A4A52;
  }
  .specimen span {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'JetBrains Mono', SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .swatch-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 16px 0 8px;
  }
  .swatch {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .swatch-chip {
    display: block;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .swatch strong {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .swatch code {
    font-size: 11px;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .brand-specimens, .swatch-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
